WEBVTT

00:00:22.210 --> 00:00:26.970
Seeking out a single ray of light,
hito-suji no hikari wo motome

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:34.210
All I can do is wander on, no matter how far.
hitasura doko made mo tada samayou

00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:42.950
As I breathe a sigh not unlike surrender,
akirame ni nita tameiki wo tsuki-nagara

00:00:43.010 --> 00:00:52.270
I don't want to fear how I've been hurt, all the time.
kizutsuku koto wo osoretaku nai yo itsu mo

00:00:52.410 --> 00:00:54.650
Set me free now!

00:00:54.670 --> 00:01:01.060
Come on, let it all go, to the far reaches of time,
saa tokihanate subete toki no kanata ni

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:01.080
From that which binds the soul!
tamashii wo shibaru mono wo

00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:06.910
tamashii wo shibaru mono wo
From that which binds the soul!

00:01:06.950 --> 00:01:09.200
For my heartbeat!

00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:11.690
Make freedom your weapon,
jiyuu wo buki ni

00:01:11.690 --> 00:01:11.760
And you are sure to attain it!
kitto te ni ireru no yo

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:15.470
kitto te ni ireru no yo
And you are sure to attain it!

00:01:15.470 --> 00:01:15.510
The power to believe and dream is there
shinjiru chikara wo yume wo

00:01:15.510 --> 00:01:21.590
shinjiru chikara wo yume wo
The power to believe and dream is there

00:01:21.590 --> 00:01:21.630
for you to go on living.
ikite yuku tame ni

00:01:21.630 --> 00:01:25.960
ikite yuku tame ni
for you to go on living.

00:01:43.970 --> 00:01:45.410
Wait!

00:01:45.470 --> 00:01:47.240
Please wait! Yuji!

00:01:54.150 --> 00:01:56.620
Yuji!!

00:02:05.830 --> 00:02:09.760
So the High Council has commenced the second airborne operation, have they?

00:02:09.830 --> 00:02:12.270
What foolishness! At this rate,

00:02:12.330 --> 00:02:16.240
the activation of the Sleeper's B cells will advance even further.

00:02:21.840 --> 00:02:28.110
Yuji... Seno Miyagi, I cannot allow Yuji to pilot the Double Edge any longer!

00:02:28.220 --> 00:02:30.480
I too am going to the surface.

00:02:30.520 --> 00:02:33.320
Descent shuttles are kept under tight management.

00:02:33.390 --> 00:02:35.380
It will be difficult for you alone.

00:02:35.460 --> 00:02:38.720
Even so...

00:02:38.790 --> 00:02:41.390
Even so, I have to go!

00:02:41.460 --> 00:02:44.060
You have to know-

00:02:44.130 --> 00:02:46.730
So long as his current condition is maintained,

00:02:46.800 --> 00:02:50.070
you will not save Kaido Yuji.

00:02:50.140 --> 00:02:52.070
We are about to take action.

00:02:52.140 --> 00:02:55.440
I would like to restrain management of the High Council

00:02:55.510 --> 00:02:57.070
with as few losses as possible.

00:02:57.150 --> 00:03:01.080
In order to do that, we need to block any outside reinforcements.

00:03:01.150 --> 00:03:05.090
I would like to leave gaining control of the shuttle dock up to you.

00:03:05.150 --> 00:03:06.980
The shuttle dock...?

00:03:41.460 --> 00:03:43.950
The bulkheads are being closed off by somebody!

00:03:44.030 --> 00:03:47.050
Unable to maintain control from here!

00:03:47.130 --> 00:03:50.720
So, they've finally moved?

00:03:50.800 --> 00:03:53.500
I didn't expect them to take advantage of this.

00:03:59.810 --> 00:04:04.750
- What's the matter!?
- Something wrong in A Block?

00:04:04.810 --> 00:04:06.800
This is an emergency order from the High Council!

00:04:06.880 --> 00:04:08.540
There is a coup d'état in progress!

00:04:08.620 --> 00:04:12.380
All security personnel report to stations immediately and put down the rebel force!

00:04:12.450 --> 00:04:13.420
That is all!

00:04:13.490 --> 00:04:16.080
A coup d'état? How ridiculous!

00:04:16.160 --> 00:04:17.990
E Block, all passages locked down.

00:04:18.060 --> 00:04:21.760
D Block appears to be momentarily rendered impassible!

00:04:21.830 --> 00:04:25.770
They intend to disperse the security forces, do they?

00:04:25.830 --> 00:04:30.500
All personnel, assume shift A-1! Defend the High Council at any cost!

00:04:43.120 --> 00:04:48.060
Orders from the High Council to continue with the second airborne operation!

00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:52.060
Tell them we acknowledge. How dare they do this now!

00:04:52.130 --> 00:04:55.030
Fortify security! Do not let a single person through!

00:05:09.810 --> 00:05:12.110
Hold on for me, Yuji...

00:05:25.490 --> 00:05:26.930
On our last mission,

00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:30.430
we were able to exterminate the largest Nest on the African continent.

00:05:30.530 --> 00:05:34.760
Our target this time is the largest Nest in North America, located in New York.

00:05:34.800 --> 00:05:37.360
We'll pulverize it all in one strike!

00:05:37.440 --> 00:05:39.910
Rick and Su, you continue to support Tony!

00:05:39.970 --> 00:05:43.710
Alicia, you take over supporting Yuji in place of Marlene!

00:05:43.780 --> 00:05:45.370
Yes!

00:05:45.450 --> 00:05:48.380
Su, is Alicia up to that?

00:05:48.450 --> 00:05:51.040
No matter, we'll just have to have her do it, right?

00:05:51.120 --> 00:05:52.280
What do you mean by that!?

00:05:52.350 --> 00:05:56.520
Since Marlene isn't here, I'll be sure to give him proper support!

00:05:56.590 --> 00:06:01.050
Right, Yuji? Yuji!?

00:06:01.130 --> 00:06:05.400
Yuji, I say! Aren't you listening!? Fine!

00:06:15.810 --> 00:06:20.410
Our attack objective has come into view!

00:06:20.480 --> 00:06:23.010
Use all force to blockade the entrance.

00:06:23.080 --> 00:06:27.650
After we've sealed in the Blue, we'll blast them together with the Nest!

00:06:34.100 --> 00:06:38.050
For this mission, one unit's miss will mean the life or death of the whole outfit!

00:06:38.130 --> 00:06:40.530
Don't forget that!

00:07:49.100 --> 00:07:51.470
The Blue are counterattacking, but the damage is slight.

00:07:51.540 --> 00:07:54.700
Each Sleeper brigade is headed toward blockading the great Nest,

00:07:54.780 --> 00:07:57.040
and the mission is being carried out according to schedule.

00:07:57.110 --> 00:07:59.050
What is the status of Tony and the others?

00:08:03.450 --> 00:08:05.780
...Alicia, what are you hanging back for!?

00:08:11.130 --> 00:08:15.390
Alicia, you are now Yuji's partner! Move it!

00:08:15.460 --> 00:08:20.330
I know! After all, right now with Marlene gone, this is my chance!

00:09:28.470 --> 00:09:30.770
Marvelous, isn't it Alicia?

00:09:32.740 --> 00:09:35.210
Seeing those two, we really might be able

00:09:35.280 --> 00:09:38.210
to exterminate the Blue from the face of the Earth.

00:10:01.440 --> 00:10:04.370
- We're off too, Su!
- Yeah...

00:10:04.440 --> 00:10:06.430
Alicia, do your best!

00:10:42.410 --> 00:10:44.610
30 meters range to the rebel force.

00:10:44.680 --> 00:10:51.680
There's about 50 of them. Our troops are already assembled at A230.

00:10:51.750 --> 00:10:54.690
What is happening with Amick?

00:10:54.760 --> 00:10:56.450
They are currently engaging the rebel force!

00:10:56.520 --> 00:10:59.050
They are requesting reinforcements.

00:11:08.770 --> 00:11:10.530
Seno Miyagi...

00:11:31.460 --> 00:11:32.520
Let's go!

00:11:41.140 --> 00:11:43.830
Code Number 2805...

00:12:12.830 --> 00:12:15.800
W- what happened!?

00:13:45.130 --> 00:13:46.390
Yuji...

00:14:20.490 --> 00:14:26.490
This is not over yet... Seno Miyagi, you are in the wrong.

00:14:32.440 --> 00:14:35.810
Seno Miyagi, we have taken control of the shuttle dock.

00:14:35.880 --> 00:14:38.710
Once preparations are complete, I will be descending to the surface.

00:14:38.780 --> 00:14:40.370
You're going, no matter what?

00:14:40.450 --> 00:14:46.050
I am ready for this. Right now, Yuji is the one who needs me most.

00:14:46.120 --> 00:14:51.750
I see, very well. Take some of the Ark soldiers with you.

00:15:23.490 --> 00:15:24.620
Yuji...

00:16:21.480 --> 00:16:25.010
Come on, Yuji, where did you go off to?

00:16:39.430 --> 00:16:42.030
What's the matter with you, Yuji?

00:16:42.100 --> 00:16:45.300
You suddenly disappear like that, and I'm going to get worried, you know!

00:16:52.110 --> 00:16:56.380
What are you doing, Yuji? You don't have to go that far!

00:16:56.450 --> 00:16:58.940
How is it that you can say such a thing?

00:16:59.020 --> 00:17:00.490
It's because we took the Blue too lightly

00:17:00.550 --> 00:17:04.050
that we ended up with this Earth, isn't it?

00:17:04.130 --> 00:17:05.720
I- I, uh...

00:17:29.480 --> 00:17:33.650
Come on, what are you doing!? You're not fighting alone here, after all, Yuji!

00:17:33.720 --> 00:17:35.350
I can't keep up with you like this!

00:17:35.420 --> 00:17:37.860
So then don't come with me!

00:17:42.760 --> 00:17:45.030
Y- you're kidding, right?

00:17:48.440 --> 00:17:50.700
Do you mean to get in my way!?

00:17:50.770 --> 00:17:52.530
If something happens because of you

00:17:52.610 --> 00:17:57.700
that threatens to make this operation fail, you'll pay for it!

00:18:05.790 --> 00:18:09.720
Yuji, what's the matter with you?

00:18:09.790 --> 00:18:11.660
The blasting of the entrance was successful.

00:18:11.730 --> 00:18:16.030
Our unit will now move to support the 3rd division.

00:18:28.810 --> 00:18:29.940
Yuji...!

00:18:39.420 --> 00:18:42.360
The 6th division has failed to seal off their entrance.

00:18:42.420 --> 00:18:43.550
A swarm of Blue have appeared.

00:18:43.620 --> 00:18:45.750
Their number seem to far surpass what was anticipated.

00:18:45.830 --> 00:18:47.620
It's relatively 4 on 6.

00:18:47.700 --> 00:18:50.690
3 on 7... Still increasing.

00:18:50.760 --> 00:18:53.230
W- what!? I- impossible!

00:19:22.800 --> 00:19:23.850
Yuji...

00:19:34.740 --> 00:19:36.330
Tony!?

00:19:36.410 --> 00:19:39.070
Alicia, come with me.

00:19:54.090 --> 00:19:56.150
Biomagnetic radio interference, huh?

00:19:59.430 --> 00:20:01.770
Where are you, Yuji...?

00:20:17.450 --> 00:20:18.440
Yuji!

00:20:45.080 --> 00:20:46.270
Yuji...?

00:20:58.430 --> 00:20:59.720
Y- Yuji!?

00:21:30.100 --> 00:21:39.590
Although the days when we smiled again and again
hohoemi kasaneta hibi ga

00:21:40.950 --> 00:21:45.720
Have passed away into dreams,
maboroshi ni natte mo

00:21:47.930 --> 00:21:54.870
I will surely not lose my way.
watashi wa kitto mayowanai

00:21:54.990 --> 00:22:01.040
To go on to the future,
mirai ni yuku tame ni

00:22:01.190 --> 00:22:07.460
To become an adult,
otona ni naru tame ni

00:22:07.820 --> 00:22:14.650
I again recall now the memories
mogaite kita omoide wo kokoro de

00:22:14.840 --> 00:22:19.810
twisting in my heart.
ima wa kurikaesu

00:22:19.910 --> 00:22:25.870
I'm living in one time,
hitotsu no toki wo iki

00:22:26.170 --> 00:22:32.150
While choosing two dreams,
futatsu no yume erabi

00:22:32.760 --> 00:22:39.630
And love taught me what it means...
soshite ai ga oshiete kureta yo ne

00:22:39.810 --> 00:22:46.490
to cherish someone.
hito wo omou imi

00:22:49.970 --> 00:22:53.880
It's all right now, Yuji. It's all right now.

00:22:53.940 --> 00:22:56.240
You are not a fighting machine.

00:22:56.310 --> 00:22:58.980
Don't concern yourself with me! I'll kill you all!

00:22:59.050 --> 00:23:01.240
The Blue, and whatever else!

00:23:01.320 --> 00:23:05.250
How can you go back for us... to the way you were?

00:23:05.320 --> 00:23:12.660
How far do I have to go? Joey... Yung... Takashi!!
